0..46 Comment "//! This source shows calls with no arguments."
47..50 Comment "//!"
51..130 Comment "//! A module member and a suspension can receive an empty call. The call forces"
131..181 Comment "//! a thunk, after the call-by-push-value of Levy."
182..185 Comment "//!"
186..265 Comment "//! The checker treats each empty call as a force of its head. The call answers"
266..321 Comment "//! at the call, as a call that applies arguments does."
322..325 Comment "//!"
326..398 Comment "//! - cites: [Levy-2003-callbypushvalue_functional_imperative_synthesis]"
399..402 Comment "//!"
403..536 Comment "//! [Levy-2003-callbypushvalue_functional_imperative_synthesis]: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-94-007-0954-6 \"Levy, Call-By-Push-Value\""
